# These vendored k8s.io protos exist only to feed tools/gen-grpc-client.sh
# (JS/Python client generation) and tools/gen-descriptors.sh (descriptor
# bundling) — see k8s.io/README.md. Go already compiles against the real
# @io_k8s_apimachinery / @io_k8s_api external repos, so there's no reason to
# also compile Go code from this copy, and doing so fails to build (its
# go_proto_library deps resolve to those same external repos' Go types,
# which don't satisfy what gogoslick generates locally, e.g. a missing
# RawExtension.Equal method).
# gazelle:go_generate_proto false
